  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Investment Climate Reform - Moldova Investment Climate Reform Project</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Reformer f&#xf6;r b&#xe4;ttre investeringsklimat</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmets m&#xe5;ls&#xe4;ttning &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra investeringsklimatet i       Moldavien samt &#xf6;ka exportkapaciteten i jordbrukssektorn genom st&#xf6;dja  den moldaviska regeringen och den privata sektorn att undanr&#xf6;ja       hinder f&#xf6;r potentiella investerare genom reformer i n&#xe4;ringslivet samt &#xf6;ka investeringar och exportkapacitet inom jordbrukssektorn genom att &#xe5;tg&#xe4;rda regelverk och otillr&#xe4;cklig kvalitet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme objective is to improve the investment climate of the   Republic of Moldova as well as to increase the export capacity of the agricultural sector, by assisting the GoM and the private sector to   remove the impediments for the potential investors through            implementing reforms in the business sector and to increase the       investments and exports capacity of the agricultural sector.</narrative>
  </description>
